OL,3,GNEWSAMining landmark restoration costs
OL,4,Amore than double
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cost of replacing a historic mining
OL,7,Flandmark in Nottinghamshire has doubled
OL,8,Fdue to "unavoidable" pressures.
OL,10,FBrowtowe Borough Council's plans to
OL,11,Freplace the Brinsley Headstocks - a
OL,12,Fwooden frame which formed part of a
OL,13,Fsystem to take miners into the pit -
OL,14,Fhas been in the works for the last two
OL,15,Fyears but the project has hit delays.
OL,17,FThe authority approved #220,000 towards
OL,18,Fthe replacement of the headstocks in
OL,19,FJanuary 2025 and it was projected the
OL,20,Finstallation would be completed by
OL,21,FApril.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
