OL,3,GNEWSAMining landmark restoration costs
OL,4,Amore than double
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, at a cabinet meeting on
OL,7,FTuesday, it was revealed the cost of
OL,8,Fthe work had more than doubled to
OL,9,F#453,000 and that progress had been
OL,10,Fimpacted by "several unforeseen
OL,11,Fchallenges".
